    <dc:description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?40921" dir="ltr"&gt;The Spiral&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044769" dir="ltr"&gt;La spirale&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?40942" dir="ltr"&gt;A Sign in Space&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044760" dir="ltr"&gt;Un segno nello spazio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1964)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?57571" dir="ltr"&gt;All at One Point&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044761" dir="ltr"&gt;Tutto in un punto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1964)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96202" dir="ltr"&gt;The Aquatic Uncle&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044764" dir="ltr"&gt;Lo zio acquatico&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96204" dir="ltr"&gt;Games Without End&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044763" dir="ltr"&gt;Giochi senza fine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96764" dir="ltr"&gt;The Light Years&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044768" dir="ltr"&gt;Gli anni-luce&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96765" dir="ltr"&gt;The Form of Space&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044767" dir="ltr"&gt;La forma dello spazio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96766" dir="ltr"&gt;The Dinosaurs&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; novelette by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044766" dir="ltr"&gt;I dinosauri&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96767" dir="ltr"&gt;How Much Shall We Bet?&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044765" dir="ltr"&gt;Quanto scommettiamo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96768" dir="ltr"&gt;Without Colors&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044762" dir="ltr"&gt;Senza colori&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1965)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96769" dir="ltr"&gt;At Daybreak&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044759" dir="ltr"&gt;Sul far del giorno&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1964)&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?96770" dir="ltr"&gt;The Distance of the Moon&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8226; shortstory by &lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/ea.cgi?2367" dir="ltr"&gt;Italo Calvino&lt;/a&gt; (trans. of &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isfdb.org/cgi-bin/title.cgi?1044758" dir="ltr"&gt;La distanza della Luna&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt; 1964)&lt;/ul&gt;</dc:description>
